# The dissipative runs ship complete: history.json holds the per-epoch loss /
# L2 curves (the only record for those runs, which predate plot_record.npz)
# and angle_latest.pth makes them resumable. They are large (~150 MB total),
# so track them with Git LFS if that matters for your clone size:
#     git lfs install
#     git lfs track "models/dissipative/**/history.json"
